 ║ PLAY ON YOUR PHONE. The web client fits a phone screen, the keyboard stays  ║
 ║ up while you chat, and the X closes it.                                     ║
 ║ A BIGGER MAP. Laptops open full screen, a line under the map names where    ║
 ║ you are and where your quest leads, and Legend shows the key.               ║
 ║ QUESTS IN THREE TABS. Active, Repeat and Completed, with a count of the     ║
 ║ work that is ready again.                                                   ║
 ║ SOUND STARTS OFF. Open Settings and tick Sound on when you want music.      ║
 ║ The novel: https://dogmud.org/novel                                         ║
 ║ Full patch notes: https://dogmud.org/patch-notes                            ║
